  "about": "Hello, I'm Nick Young! I am a fresh out of college graduate that attended Miami University of Oxford. I received my bachelor's in computer science and have a passion for software development. I do have experience from working on a website for a non-profit organization known as the Army of Kindness. I was the back-end developer for this team that worked under agile development. I worked on progression for the database as well as made a ASP.net C# API that worked wonderfully to complete the system for this non-profit. I worked on this project for a year and have developed a strong understanding of C# and .NET development. I loved working with this project as it brought me so much joy when I saw the smile on the client's face when we showed her the final product. I wish to bring the same determined and hard-working mindset to the next workplace.",
